WMem training release

This release packages the final Method13 training implementation.
Its distributed training and recurrent rollout infrastructure builds on
verl, MemAgent, and MemCoE. Existing source copyright and license notices
have been retained.

Upstream projects:
  https://github.com/volcengine/verl
  https://github.com/BytedTsinghua-SIA/MemAgent
  https://github.com/Applied-Machine-Learning-Lab/ACL2026_MemCoE

The Apache License 2.0 text for files carrying that notice is included at
licenses/Apache-2.0.txt. This notice does not relicense code from other sources.

The release omits standalone inference/evaluation entry points, model weights,
datasets, experiment logs, cached bytecode and machine-specific output files.
Training-time rollout and frozen reward/label inference remain necessary
parts of reinforcement learning. The MGI_module subset provides only the
PersonaMem loader, tokenizer configuration and retrieval preprocessing.
